    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">JPD316 · Chapter 2 · Session 36</span>\n<h2>Session 36 — 36. Bài 2 (L2-17)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13933 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">JPD316 · Chương 2 · Buổi 36</span>\n<h2>Buổi 36 — 36. Bài 2 (L2-17)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13933 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1,3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1,3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>36. Bài 2 (L2-17)<br>Tăng cường kỹ năng đọc bằng tài liệu giảng dạy khác (GV tự chuẩn bị)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>1) Giáo trình chính<br>2) Các slide của Bài 2</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>1) Nắm được các nội dung của bài học<br>2) Tham gia thảo luận về chủ đề liên quan đến bài đọc<br>3) Đọc bài đọc<br>4) Dùng AI (chat gpt, copilot,v.v...) để tra cứu thông tin từ vựng và các bài đọc có liên quan đến chủ đề</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 (10 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by the session number in the deck name. File: JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 (10 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo số buổi ghi trong tên deck. Tệp: JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/001.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 1: 第4課\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 1/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>第4課<br>地域を知って生活する</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/002.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 2: CDA13\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 2/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>CDA13<br>1<br>2<br>3<br>4<br>5<br>こんなときどうする？(52)<br>I<br>SLOT 36<br>耳でキャッチ(52)</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/003.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 3: 耳でキャッチ （P52）\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 3/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>耳でキャッチ　（P52）<br>できること<br>施設を利用するのに分からないことがあったとき、職員の説明を聞き取ることができる。</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/004.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 4/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/005.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 5: 耳でキャッチ （P52）\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>耳でキャッチ　（P52）<br>公民館の会議室を借りるために予定を取りに来ました。<br>職員の説明を聞きましょう。<br>CDA13</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/006.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 6: 耳でキャッチ （P52）\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 6/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>耳でキャッチ　（P52）<br>会議室を利用する場合、何をしなければいけませんか。<br>利用者登録するとき、何が必要ですか。</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/007.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 7\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 7/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/008.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 8: 施設の利用方法の説明で使われる言葉・表現 （ワークブック―２６ページ）\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 8/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>施設の利用方法の説明で使われる言葉・表現　（ワークブック―２６ページ）</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/009.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 9: こんなときどうする？ （P52）\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 9/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>こんなときどうする？　（P52）<br>アパートの管 理 人さんに困 っていることを説明して、解 決してほしいと 頼 んでください。CD（Ａ-14）を聞いて会話を続けてください。<br>CD・A14</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JPD316/flm1/d33/010.webp\" alt=\"JPD316 · JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 10: こんなときどうする？ （P52）\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">JPD316-BÀI 4-SLOT 36 · slide 10/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>こんなときどうする？　（P52）<br>生活していて困っていることがありますか。そんな時、どうしていますか。<br>隣の人がうるさくて困る時、どうしますか。</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
